1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Every year across India, organizing a public initiative or institution starts with a vision.

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:16,000
Yet obtaining statutory permissions often turns into an overwhelming maze of physical dossiers and uncertainty.

3
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:26,000
Multiple follow-ups, unmonitored review queues, and lack of visibility cause delays that stall operations.

4
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:35,000
What if this journey could be streamlined into one transparent platform? Introducing AnumatiSetu.

5
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:47,000
AnumatiSetu brings permission governance into a unified digital environment with role-based access.

6
00:00:47,000 --> 00:01:02,000
The executive dashboard provides operational clarity, tracking application volumes and turnaround metrics.

7
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:14,000
Applicants initiate new permission requests through a guided three-step wizard.

8
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:27,000
Course expansions are validated and documents verified before instant digital submission.

9
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:35,000
Applicants track their application through every statutory milestone without guesswork.

10
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:44,000
The transparent lifecycle highlights current review stages, target due dates, and risk scoring.

11
00:01:44,000 --> 00:02:00,000
The administrative workbench centralizes dossier evaluation, document inspection, and deficiency notices.

12
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:10,000
Universal accessibility is built in with instant translation across English, Hindi, and Marathi.

13
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:20,000
Automated PDF OCR engine extracts certificate metadata with over 95% accuracy.

14
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:31,000
AnumatiSetu's novelty lies in algorithmic conflict guards preventing biased assignments.

15
00:02:31,000 --> 00:02:43,000
Proactive 3-tier SLA escalations and tamper-evident audit logs ensure institutional accountability.

16
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:52,000
AnumatiSetu transforms institutional permissions into a transparent digital service.

17
00:02:52,000 --> 00:03:00,000
AnumatiSetu — Simplifying Permissions. Connecting People. Enabling Transparency. Thank you.
